{"id":"648981","name":"羊肉拌苜蓿","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/648981/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"苜蓿","amount":"150g"},{"name":"羊肉","amount":"些许"}],"sub":[{"name":"开水","amount":"50g(或高汤)"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"把苜蓿洗净。","img":"images/648981/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅烧开水，放苜蓿焯水。","img":"images/648981/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮开锅几十秒。","img":"images/648981/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"过冷水。","img":"images/648981/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大蒜处理干净。","img":"images/648981/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切末。","img":"images/648981/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取煮过的羊蝎子，把大部分揉洗净给老母亲做菜了，剩下肉骨头我把能撕下来的肉都取下来。","img":"images/648981/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"苜蓿撰干水分切一下。","img":"images/648981/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"所有食材放一起，放食盐。","img":"images/648981/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放味精。","img":"images/648981/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放高汤和香油。","img":"images/648981/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/648981/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/648981/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"拌菜的时候一定放点高汤啥的，要不太干了。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}